{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">操作步骤如下：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">1、使用搜索引擎（例如百度）搜索关键词“京东物流”，点击进入官网，或点击 <a href=\"/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>www.jdl.com</strong></span> </span></a>直接访问。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/157121/17/29033/253500/63ea03c2F8010b151/78ecd9ada985635a.png\"/></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br/><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">2、进入官网，在顶部导航栏-服务支持-商家服务，可以找到<strong><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://wl.jdl.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">商家工作台</a></strong>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/45041/21/23009/304292/63ea03c7Fe5e435d4/00dcf17bb77a2d83.png\"/></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br/><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">3、进入<strong><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://wl.jdl.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">商家工作台</a></strong>需要登录账号，界面如下。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://wl.jdl.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/125325/12/29998/208552/63ea03cdFc0c0e848/c38043f35a25490f.png\"/></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br/><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">4、如未开通账号，则显示如下界面，可以点击“<a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/ecology/cooperation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">意向合作</a>”或“<a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://contract.jdl.com/platform/contractList\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">申请签约</a>”。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://wl.jdl.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/142225/15/20930/107954/63ea03d1F8f340757/7fcd02bf524adc7b.png\"/></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br/><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">5、选择“<a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/ecology/cooperation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">意向合作</a>”后填写表单信息，销售人员会主动联系。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"/ecology/cooperation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/223681/20/17056/284442/63ea03d6F79a5f548/a4da7c31be7198d0.png\"/></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br/><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">6、手机端也可以按同样路径找到商家工作台，即：打开手机浏览器，使用搜索引擎搜索关键词“京东物流”后点击进入，或点击 <span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">www.jdl.com</a></strong></span> </span>直接访问。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/129672/8/31071/45562/63ea0468F3ff97254/4d5cb65e523aaeaf.png\"/></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br/><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">7、进入手机端官网，左上角找到导航栏-服务支持-商家服务，可以找到<strong>商家工作台</strong>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/98719/29/33071/49181/63ea046fFcf69e956/b7dffe7913864db4.png\"/> <img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/112814/28/19591/20742/63ea0474F4a1ee7ab/a119bd327a9f1d06.png\"/></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/142877/5/33430/43354/63e9f0b3Fb698e07a/59391fafd0307d6b.png\"/></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "京东物流官网，登录京东物流商家工作台的方式", "contentCode": "content01049", "contentTitle": "京东物流商家工作台登录入口在哪？", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1676272459000, "id": 2845, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/147945/13/29792/46747/63e9e714F6594be31/19cfdfaed14d5676.jpg", "updateTime": 1678761959000}}